{"id":"659999","name":"四季豆炒猪皮","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"","cover":"images/659999/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"四季豆","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"火葱头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青辣椒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪皮洗净，冷水下锅焯水2分钟。","img":"images/659999/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"捞出冷却后，用刀把脂肪刮干净。","img":"images/659999/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切成条。","img":"images/659999/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入锅中，加水、姜片、料酒烧15分钟。","img":"images/659999/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出沥去汤汁。","img":"images/659999/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"四季豆择洗干净。","img":"images/659999/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"沸水中加点盐和油，放入四季豆焯水3分钟，捞出过凉。","img":"images/659999/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"火葱头、辣椒切好备用。","img":"images/659999/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"热锅冷油，放入火葱头、辣椒炒香。","img":"images/659999/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入猪皮翻炒，加料酒、生抽调味。","img":"images/659999/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"合入四季豆炒2分钟，加盐调味。","img":"images/659999/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/659999/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}